            "prospective_availability": "RETROSPECTIVELY_RECONSTRUCTED_PRE_TARGET"
          },
          "IK-1870868:L212:span4": {
            "text": "The Rent Controller, at the floor level, ordered eviction and the Appellate Tribunal affirmed it, upholding the vice of sub-letting without consent of the landlord in the manner specified in cite23†s. 14(1)(b)",
